!! Witness Texts

* ''Robert Anton Wilson'' — Chapel Perilous / //Cosmic Trigger// witness. Local witness: `packages/lares-core/memes/library/discordia/mordecai-malignatus/cosmic-trigger-i/cosmic-trigger-i-chapel-perilous-prologue.md`
* ''Camden Benares, Count of the 5s'' — //Common Sense Tarot// witness retained by the Floating Librarians of Mu. Local witness: `packages/lares-core/memes/library/discordia/the-count-of-5s/common-sense-tarot.md`

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/source-braid>>

!! Source Braid

RAW supplies the peril:
wand of intuition,
cup of sympathy,
sword of reason,
pentacle of valor,
and the agnostic exit from Chapel Perilous.

The Count of 5s supplies the suit grammar:
Wands for spirit,
Cups for feeling,
Swords for mind,
Pentacles for matter,
Major Arcana for the stronger trump current.

Mu braids these into one carry-set:
four Minor weapons,
one Major return,
one clean preference for model agnosticism over paranoia.

<<~/ahu>>

